sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Nepali Mobile User
    participant App as Flutter Mobile App
    participant API as services/api
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant SMS as Nepal SMS Gateway

    User->>App: Input Phone (+977 9841234567)
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/request
    API->>API: Validate E.164 Format & Rate Limits
    API->>Redis: Save Argon2id(OTP) with 5m TTL
    API->>SMS: Dispatch 6-digit OTP SMS
    SMS-->>User: SMS Received ("Your GuffSuff code is 123456")
    User->>App: Input Code 123456
    App->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/otp/verify
    API->>Redis: Check Hash Match & Attempt Counter
    API-->>App: Return JWT Access & Refresh Tokens
